OL,3,AItaly fines Meta bB,805m over accessing
OL,4,Ausers' photos
OL,5,
OL,6,FItalian regulators have fined social
OL,7,Fmedia giant Meta bB,805m (#670; $887m)
OL,8,Ffor accessing Android users' photos
OL,9,Fwithout their specific consent.
OL,11,FItaly's Data Protection Authority said
OL,12,FMeta did not properly inform about 20
OL,13,Fmillion smartphone users that it had
OL,14,Faccess to their photos and videos via a
OL,15,Ffeature of the Facebook app.
OL,17,FIt has given Meta 60 days to disable
OL,18,Fthe feature by default and seek users'
OL,19,Fconsent separately.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/18
